    "innovation": "Through cloud-resolving simulations, this study demonstrates that the rapid seasonal warming of the East China Sea is a critical factor controlling the July peak of torrential rainfall over western Japan and that its future warming will substantially increase precipitation in such extreme events.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
